Subject: [PATCH] Public API body request limiting (#51422)

This adds a new setting and limiting for /v3-public API endpoints.

There are two mechanisms for configuring some limits - the public API
Server uses the settings, but due to settings being lazily loaded, we
use an environment variable based value for the auth-server.
---
